Package: xfce4-squeezebox-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: rhythmbox | mpd | audacious | exaile | quodlibet
Suggests: mpd, gmpc, muine, banshee, pragha, radiotray
Description: Media player control plugin for the Xfce panel
 Remote control various media players from the panel.
 Show album art popups and have media key response.
 .
 Supports multiple backends including Rhythmbox, MPD,
 Audacious, Exaile, QuodLibet, Muine, Banshee, Pragha,
 and RadioTray.
 .
 Features:
  - Control playback (play/pause, next, previous)
  - Album art display in tooltips
  - Desktop notifications on track changes
  - Global media key support
  - Wayland and X11 compatible via libxfce4windowing

